# Unity's standard ignore list (from github/gitignore, Unity.gitignore). sq init put it here, in your
# Unity project folder, so that its patterns - *.csproj and *.sln among them - only apply to this folder.
# The project and solution files Unity generates for your IDE are rebuilt from Assets/ every time.

